WEBVTT

00:00.370 --> 00:02.660
M-My hatred...

00:02.660 --> 00:05.220
w-won't go away!

00:05.700 --> 00:07.040
Spokesperson!

00:07.630 --> 00:10.420
If the heroes win here,

00:10.420 --> 00:15.600
then nothing will change!

00:16.010 --> 00:17.380
It's the call to action--

00:17.380 --> 00:19.110
From that night!

00:19.410 --> 00:22.830
Comrades! Raise your voices!

00:23.120 --> 00:25.640
Follow me!

00:30.470 --> 00:32.340
They're gaining momentum!

00:32.860 --> 00:34.350
There's no end to them!

00:34.700 --> 00:36.230
We can't hold it any longer!

00:36.570 --> 00:38.100
They're pushing us back!

00:39.350 --> 00:42.080
W-We can't last much longer...

00:54.890 --> 00:58.490
Kurogiri was transported
to the research building.

00:59.530 --> 01:04.770
Once you reach him, have him listen to
a recording of my or Tomura's voice.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.060
Kurogiri's Quirk will decide this fight.

01:11.050 --> 01:15.340
You will become a hero for Tomura's sake.

01:32.590 --> 01:37.250
When the heroes were
investigating Jaku Hospital,

01:37.960 --> 01:39.700
the first thing they did

01:40.210 --> 01:45.150
was make sure the patients
and staff were safe.

01:45.860 --> 01:49.170
Well? What about you?

01:50.960 --> 01:53.120
Do you have a plan?!

01:54.710 --> 01:56.340
Say that you do!

03:52.760 --> 03:54.620
I thought I would never amount to anything.

03:55.560 --> 03:59.690
I thought, if I followed
you, I could be somebody.

04:02.400 --> 04:05.310
Shigaraki! Watch me!

04:13.830 --> 04:17.970
Look at all the people behind me--

04:30.710 --> 04:33.110
Shoji's voice reached them.

04:34.580 --> 04:38.120
And that guy's not going
to be your secret weapon.

04:40.080 --> 04:40.830
Kurogiri--

04:40.830 --> 04:49.470
Shirakumo...!

04:51.950 --> 04:53.250
The recording...!

04:54.970 --> 04:59.100
If it's not All For One
or Shigaraki's voice,

04:59.870 --> 05:02.200
he won't wake up...!

05:06.860 --> 05:09.830
Several minutes earlier

05:16.630 --> 05:19.120
I'll go after Spinner, who
went into the hospital!

05:19.720 --> 05:23.530
Please do what you can to keep
the rest from coming in!

05:29.230 --> 05:30.620
We can't...

05:48.830 --> 05:51.520
I...

05:52.770 --> 05:56.740
I might've used my anger in the wrong way...

05:57.160 --> 05:58.680
Don't lose your nerve!

05:58.680 --> 06:01.570
Don't stop moving! Follow the spokesperson!

06:01.840 --> 06:05.550
Everyone here is at fault for turning
a blind eye to what was happening!

06:05.550 --> 06:07.630
It's time to teach them a lesson!

06:07.630 --> 06:10.190
Just think of all the poor
treatment you've received!

06:10.460 --> 06:12.340
I-I'm thinking about it!

06:12.940 --> 06:16.100
People raise their hand toward me
even though I didn't do anything!

06:16.450 --> 06:19.870
Thinking about it makes my blood boil!

06:20.750 --> 06:21.620
But--

06:24.940 --> 06:27.650
Will you laugh at me for seeming frivolous?

06:28.730 --> 06:33.160
It really did raise my spirits when I
heard rumors of the call to action--

06:33.470 --> 06:35.910
When I heard that silence was evil,

06:35.910 --> 06:41.250
and that we should turn the world
that deserted us upside down.

06:41.840 --> 06:44.210
And when I heard that
there was a spokesperson!

06:44.820 --> 06:47.470
But this isn't the way to do it!

06:48.760 --> 06:51.020
Who cares!

06:51.860 --> 06:55.770
I don't know! What does "everyone" mean?!

06:56.710 --> 06:59.310
The people inside the hospital--

06:59.310 --> 07:02.360
The doctors who are trying
to protect the patients--

07:02.650 --> 07:04.320
I-I...

07:04.810 --> 07:07.450
...couldn't hit them!

07:09.400 --> 07:10.780
Stop it! Stop it!

07:10.780 --> 07:12.530
Think calmly about this!

07:12.930 --> 07:15.200
That octopus is becoming a thorn.

07:15.200 --> 07:20.740
The heteromorphs are finally radicalized
enough to become a meat shield.

07:20.740 --> 07:23.880
Their passion was to make us supreme!

07:24.210 --> 07:25.880
Why did you stop?

07:25.880 --> 07:27.660
This is a revolution!

07:27.660 --> 07:30.230
Move forward and destroy it all!

07:31.430 --> 07:33.090
Was I wrong...?

07:33.680 --> 07:37.850
Should I have just sat down quietly...?

07:40.420 --> 07:46.980
The feelings that made you stand
today were not in vain or wrong.

07:48.030 --> 07:52.030
Those who hurt us still need
to be brought to light.

07:53.140 --> 07:55.780
You didn't stop thinking,

07:56.470 --> 07:59.860
and that makes you shine bright in my eyes.

08:00.810 --> 08:04.340
That light will spread.

08:04.730 --> 08:08.380
And with that light, let's
change those who hurt others.

08:09.270 --> 08:14.340
Until they are ashamed
of their own punches.

08:19.640 --> 08:21.090
The momentum...

08:27.270 --> 08:30.030
I've etched your voices into my heart.

08:30.580 --> 08:32.380
Sorry for not realizing.

08:34.630 --> 08:38.480
If it was just us, we would've
tried to stop them with force.

08:41.790 --> 08:43.840
Let's go support those
fighting in the hospital!

08:43.840 --> 08:45.190
Okay!

09:01.290 --> 09:05.390
Ever since then, he hasn't even twitched.

09:06.840 --> 09:10.370
Maybe he's been broken for a long time.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.580
M...

09:14.110 --> 09:17.320
My mind is blank...

09:17.790 --> 09:21.080
My body won't listen to me...

09:21.850 --> 09:23.630
This is as far as I got...

09:24.130 --> 09:26.630
No one's behind me...

09:26.630 --> 09:29.310
I can't wake up Kurogiri, either...

09:29.990 --> 09:33.330
What, so you're just an empty cosplayer?

09:33.330 --> 09:36.640
That's right! I'm completely empty inside!

09:37.140 --> 09:41.080
There was never anything inside my heart.

09:41.910 --> 09:43.560
I got carried away by the passion

09:43.960 --> 09:45.480
and took a stand.

09:46.550 --> 09:48.810
Think about how you're using your anger!

09:49.740 --> 09:51.530
I DID think about it!

09:52.000 --> 09:55.830
All I thought was that I
wanted to follow him.

09:57.500 --> 09:59.670
I'm going to crush them.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.580
To where he...

10:04.040 --> 10:05.660
was standing...

10:08.150 --> 10:09.950
Spinner's stopped!

10:12.000 --> 10:16.950
Yamada, just in case it looks like
they're about to get Kurogiri back...

10:17.830 --> 10:22.100
Since our plan to split them up was
necessary, this was the last resort.

10:24.010 --> 10:26.470
Hey, Shirakumo.

10:27.550 --> 10:31.020
That guy's already lost an eye and a leg.

10:32.350 --> 10:35.620
Don't make him lose his fond memories, too.

10:36.880 --> 10:41.340
If you're not Shirakumo, then
just stay a memory and go away.

10:43.190 --> 10:49.670
But if you're still our
friend from back then...

10:59.240 --> 11:03.370
We had more in common than I expected...
like videogames and stuff...

11:04.300 --> 11:07.230
I thought, if he would just remember...

11:12.460 --> 11:13.840
LooL?

11:13.840 --> 11:16.420
I played it, too. I was
a solo player, though.

11:21.230 --> 11:24.380
Go save Shigaraki and the others...

11:24.380 --> 11:27.530
Shirakumo...!

11:57.540 --> 12:02.780
I... am the one who will
protect Tomura Shigaraki.

12:25.590 --> 12:32.000
The cumulonimbus cloud that suddenly
appeared over Japan is still developing quickly.

12:32.000 --> 12:37.250
It may ride on the jet stream and affect
weather in North America, too.

12:38.230 --> 12:41.280
According to the National Weather Service,

12:41.280 --> 12:44.610
a convection current caused by
simultaneous temperature spikes

12:44.610 --> 12:50.300
and a tropical cyclone from the southwest
appear to have come together

12:50.300 --> 12:54.250
to form an unprecedented
pyrocumulonimbus cloud.

12:55.680 --> 13:00.880
Can a butterfly that flaps its wings
in Brazil cause a hurricane in Texas?

13:00.880 --> 13:06.660
Will superhuman society, which began with
a glowing baby, be overwhelmed by chaos?

13:08.630 --> 13:11.360
The world can change with
the power of one person.

13:12.060 --> 13:13.930
Meryl? What are you talking about?

13:13.930 --> 13:15.540
I firmly oppose the government--

13:15.540 --> 13:21.250
no, the world's decision to
curry favor with All For One.

13:20.490 --> 13:22.190
Wh...? Meryl?

13:22.190 --> 13:27.700
Washington State, America

13:22.490 --> 13:24.450
Cut to a commercial! A commercial!

13:24.450 --> 13:27.150
Oh no, it's all over now!

13:27.700 --> 13:30.780
Kamino Ward, Kanagawa

13:31.880 --> 13:34.170
What's this firepower?!

13:34.170 --> 13:36.740
Todoroki, you'll burn, too.

13:36.740 --> 13:38.360
You can't fight him again right now.

13:38.360 --> 13:40.610
Phosphor was your body's limit!

13:40.610 --> 13:42.250
Everyone's at their limit!

13:42.600 --> 13:45.340
Everyone's fighting hard past their limits!

13:45.340 --> 13:49.720
But he's the only one that's still moving!

13:50.310 --> 13:54.470
I've got my dad's blood in me, too.

13:54.470 --> 13:57.340
Why is Toya the only one still moving?!

13:58.660 --> 14:01.230
So Dad's at Gunga?

14:01.920 --> 14:03.620
That's too far.

14:03.620 --> 14:06.300
Warp's really a pain.

14:07.510 --> 14:10.490
If I try to keep fighting
like this with Shoto

14:10.490 --> 14:12.580
so I can bring Dad a gift,

14:14.230 --> 14:16.750
my body won't last.

14:20.030 --> 14:22.260
Is he trying to fly over
to where our dad is?

14:23.170 --> 14:26.290
This is past what someone can do
with willpower and bloodline.

14:27.010 --> 14:28.480
Something's strange...

14:28.480 --> 14:30.860
I thought his body wasn't
compatible with fire.

14:30.860 --> 14:33.300
Why is he still able to hold his shape?

14:33.740 --> 14:34.900
Wait!

14:34.900 --> 14:36.920
I can still move!

14:36.920 --> 14:38.800
Weren't you going to kill me?

14:38.800 --> 14:41.800
You're the half-baked one now!

14:42.720 --> 14:44.070
Mr. Daddy Issues,

14:44.470 --> 14:47.770
I know I told you not to talk
to me, but I have good news.

14:52.730 --> 14:55.080
It looks like your travel
expenses have been covered.

14:56.500 --> 14:59.960
Coffin in the Sky

14:57.930 --> 14:59.950
The wind is getting stronger!

14:59.950 --> 15:02.740
I might not be able to control
the water properly--

15:02.740 --> 15:04.680
Monoma, are you okay?

15:04.680 --> 15:08.200
This fight's definitely making
it into the textbooks, right?

15:08.470 --> 15:12.330
I'll make the Ministry of Education
write that we won because of me!

15:13.090 --> 15:20.970
Inside, Edge Shot, Lemillion, Jeanist, and
Midoriya are all still doing their best!

15:21.300 --> 15:24.530
All I have to do is not blink!

15:24.530 --> 15:27.170
There's no way I'm going
to whine about that!

15:30.070 --> 15:35.400
Experiences in one's youth determine
a person's whole life.

15:39.210 --> 15:43.620
Above all else, I trust people's emotions.

15:45.440 --> 15:50.630
The feelings he has for his
friend after a dark life...

15:51.470 --> 15:54.050
Gunga Villa Site

15:51.990 --> 15:56.820
In order to allow Kurogiri, with no access
to information, to act immediately,

15:56.820 --> 16:00.720
there is a microdevice
embedded in Shimura's hand.

16:01.990 --> 16:04.480
Iguchi, your job is complete!

16:09.660 --> 16:11.410
Dad...

16:14.240 --> 16:15.950
And...

16:18.580 --> 16:21.750
Hawks...!

16:23.130 --> 16:29.470
The sad man's death created
animosity in a girl's heart.

16:30.290 --> 16:34.510
The man who wanted to drag everything
into it to clear his grudges

16:34.510 --> 16:38.660
gave the girl what she needed
to bring ruin to the country.

16:39.640 --> 16:42.650
Now, Takami. Take a look.

16:43.580 --> 16:48.460
If you hadn't prioritized
getting rid of him back then,

16:48.460 --> 16:50.390
what do you think would've happened?

16:52.140 --> 16:55.400
Kill him! Right now!

16:57.410 --> 17:00.410
Several minutes earlier

17:00.410 --> 17:03.410
Okuto Island

17:11.630 --> 17:12.810
Froppy!

17:15.770 --> 17:19.760
What she's using to conceal herself
is a type of misdirection.

17:20.460 --> 17:23.020
It's probably something really
complicated and subtle.

17:23.380 --> 17:27.780
That means there's probably a limit to how
many people she can use it on at once.

17:29.970 --> 17:32.000
With a sensor-type hero

17:32.000 --> 17:35.440
and at least four who can mark
her and support each other--

17:39.530 --> 17:40.370
On your left!

17:40.370 --> 17:42.690
Stop, Himiko Toga!

17:57.070 --> 17:58.630
This guy...

17:58.630 --> 18:00.840
doesn't have super regeneration!

18:01.230 --> 18:03.500
The villain numbers are going down!

18:03.500 --> 18:06.310
If we can hold back the Near
High Ends, then we can do this!

18:06.310 --> 18:11.470
It's our mission to take control
over these guys on this island!

18:16.690 --> 18:20.580
The fewer there are on our side,
the harder it is for me to run.

18:20.580 --> 18:22.230
They're starting to be able to catch me.

18:22.730 --> 18:26.600
With the amount of Jin's blood I have,
my limit is about 30 or 40 minutes.

18:28.280 --> 18:31.050
Even if I drink it now and turn
the tables numbers-wise,

18:31.910 --> 18:34.850
Sad Man's Parade will end
on this outlying island.

18:35.750 --> 18:38.330
In the first place, even if
we gain the upper hand here,

18:38.330 --> 18:41.980
it's hard to believe that they'd let
a ship through to bring us back.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.580
They split us up...

18:44.580 --> 18:47.630
Do the heroes already
know about Jin's blood?

18:47.630 --> 18:50.950
In any case, at this rate, it'll
end with me not doing anything.

18:51.650 --> 18:52.910
In that case...

18:54.290 --> 19:02.320
Up until now, Himiko Toga never really
acted with broader tactics in mind.

19:03.290 --> 19:07.890
However, the animosity and resignation
that started to sprout within her

19:07.890 --> 19:11.850
turned Toga into a complete villain.

19:12.770 --> 19:14.980
I'll bet it all on Spinner!

19:14.980 --> 19:18.000
I'll do what I have to do!

19:18.280 --> 19:20.080
Here it comes! Her stock of blood!

19:20.780 --> 19:23.080
All For One? Shigaraki?

19:23.080 --> 19:24.710
Whose blood is it?

19:25.040 --> 19:26.790
I won't wait around to find out!

19:30.050 --> 19:32.010
Tsu always thinks calmly.

19:32.810 --> 19:34.850
That's why that was a fake!

19:36.090 --> 19:40.300
It's a chemical used to attract
Nomu that All For One gave me.

19:43.190 --> 19:44.400
Froppy!

19:45.800 --> 19:48.580
But I can't let my guard down yet.

19:49.160 --> 19:52.180
In order to make sure I
carry out Jin's march,

19:53.210 --> 19:55.080
I have to decide in an instant!

19:55.540 --> 19:56.750
Slurp.

20:03.740 --> 20:04.970
And then,

20:05.350 --> 20:08.800
her animosity created a miracle.

20:11.190 --> 20:14.810
I have to save Shigaraki and the others...

20:16.070 --> 20:20.820
Himiko Toga, what do you want to do?

20:23.110 --> 20:27.580
I want to annihilate all the
heroes, starting with Hawks.

20:30.310 --> 20:33.540
Scatter me everywhere, Kurogiri!

20:33.540 --> 20:35.550
Wait!

20:36.910 --> 20:38.120
Not yet!

20:43.350 --> 20:46.890
I still haven't gotten to
talk about romance with you!

20:47.880 --> 20:49.240
Ochaco...

20:51.800 --> 20:55.040
I wish... we could've...

20:57.110 --> 21:00.070
The Present

21:00.760 --> 21:02.020
It's Toga!

21:02.650 --> 21:05.320
She had some of Bubaigawara's blood?

21:06.430 --> 21:10.530
I thought I got rid of it all when I was
undercover with the Liberation Army.

21:10.530 --> 21:12.670
I even got rid of all the blood
stains after the battle!

21:15.230 --> 21:17.430
Was Dabi behind this?!

21:18.420 --> 21:20.110
It's too late!

21:21.540 --> 21:26.690
Whether you cry or laugh, tomorrow
will come with impartiality.

21:26.690 --> 21:30.920
If that's the case, then
let's laugh, Himiko Toga.

21:31.960 --> 21:35.440
Let's continue his march of grief.

21:36.820 --> 21:38.470
Infinite Doubles...

21:38.470 --> 21:41.370
Sad Man's Death Parade!

21:42.060 --> 21:44.590
Then, we'll be the ones...

21:45.950 --> 21:47.630
...with the last laugh.

23:19.960 --> 23:21.960
Preview

23:20.850 --> 23:21.950
Here's the preview.

23:22.590 --> 23:26.380
Himiko Toga has transformed
using Twice's blood,

23:26.380 --> 23:29.390
and gets sent to each location
using Kurogiri's Warp.

23:29.390 --> 23:32.510
Infinite Doubles: Sad Man's Death Parade

23:32.510 --> 23:35.120
dramatically changes the
state of the battle.

23:36.020 --> 23:39.000
Do the heroes have a way to fight back?

23:39.740 --> 23:42.700
Next time, "The Chain Thus Far."

23:43.330 --> 23:45.950
Yesterday's villain is today's hero.

23:45.940 --> 23:49.940
Next time: The Chain Thus Far

23:46.680 --> 23:48.200
Go beyond!

23:48.200 --> 23:49.490
Plus Ultra!
